  "label": "Crematorium",
  "description": "A facility designed for the incineration of human remains. In the context of Nazi concentration camps, crematoria were used for mass cremation of murdered prisoners, including Jews, Roma, and others. The image shows a crematorium at Buchenwald, which was used for this purpose during the Holocaust. The claim in the meme that bones of anti-Nazi women are still present is historically inaccurate.",
